  "The memory-updating participants have 2128 to 2136 rows, not one fixed number: the paper gives the washout (null) trials before each triplet as a variable number, and the extra rows are all null trials. For participant 13 the authors' TrialNumber jumps from 1666 to 1669 once; the rows are kept as they are.",
